sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant WF as LangGraph Workflow
    participant HF as Hugging Face LLM
    participant HFAPI as HF Inference API

    Note over WF: Nodes 1-4 succeed
    WF->>HF: generate_report

    loop Retry max 5 attempts
        HF->>HFAPI: POST to Qwen model
        HFAPI--xHF: 429 Too Many Requests
        HF->>HF: Wait exponential backoff
    end

    HF--xWF: RetryError exhausted
    WF->>WF: Set error state

    Note over WF: Conditional edge - abort
    WF-->>WF: route to END
